---

<Layout title="Credits">
	<h2 class="section-title">クレジット ~ Credits & Provenance</h2>

	<div class="links-intro">
		<p>
			<strong>Touhou Project</strong> and all its characters are © <strong>ZUN / Team Shanghai Alice</strong>.
			This is a fan-made, non-profit website. No copyright infringement intended — all listed works belong to their respective owners.
		</p>
	</div>

	<h3 class="section-title">Per-song Backgrounds (背景)</h3>
	<p class="section-subtitle-desc">
		The 16 backgrounds in <code>public/backgrounds/</code> were collected before this credits page existed.
		Their content descriptions come from the site's graphify vision extraction; a web search could not trace
		them to a specific artist or page, so where the source is unknown it simply says so — no invented URLs here.
	</p>
	<div class="provenance-table-wrap">
		<table class="provenance-table">
			<thead>
				<tr><th>File</th><th>Track / Theme</th><th>Shown</th><th>Origin</th></tr>
			</thead>
			<tbody>
				{backgrounds.map((bg) => (
					<tr>
						<td><code>{bg.file}</code></td>
						<td>{bg.track}</td>
						<td>{bg.desc}</td>
						<td>{bg.origin} — preexisting repository asset (origin not documented)</td>
					</tr>
				))}
			</tbody>
		</table>
	</div>

	<h3 class="section-title">Music (音楽)</h3>
	<p class="section-subtitle-desc">
		The BGM playlist features the OST of <em>東方紅魔郷 ~ the Embodiment of Scarlet Devil</em> (2002),
		composed by <strong>ZUN / Team Shanghai Alice</strong>. All rights to the music belong to them.
	</p>

	<h3 class="section-title">Font (フォント)</h3>
	<p class="section-subtitle-desc">
		The display font is <strong>DFPPOPCorn-W12</strong>, a commercial typeface by <strong>DynaComware Japan</strong>.
		It is self-hosted in <code>/fonts/</code> for display purposes only; the font remains the property of DynaComware,
		and its usage on this site does not imply endorsement. If you redistribute this site, review DynaComware's license terms first.
	</p>
	<p class="section-subtitle-desc">
		The browser chrome and section tabs use <strong>Monapo</strong>, a free TrueType font that combines
		<strong>IPA P Gothic (ipagp)</strong> with <strong>monafont</strong> to reproduce MS PGothic's metrics
		(the 2ch ASCII-art standard font), maintained by <strong>utuhiro</strong>. Self-hosted in
		<code>/fonts/monapo.ttf</code> from
		<a href="https://github.com/utuhiro78/modified-fonts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/utuhiro78/modified-fonts</a>,
		distributed under the <a href="https://github.com/utuhiro78/modified-fonts/blob/main/monapo-20170722/IPA_Font_License_Agreement_v1.0.txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IPA Font License Agreement v1.0</a>.
	</p>

	<h3 class="section-title">Buttons & Blinkies (バナー)</h3>
	<p class="section-subtitle-desc">
		Real graphics only — see our <a href="/links">button collection</a>. Each item's provenance:
	</p>
	<ul class="credits-list">
		<li>
			<code>88x31/moriya.png</code> — Moriya Shrine's official button, courtesy of
			<a href="https://moriya-shrine.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">moriya-shrine.org</a>.
		</li>
		<li><code>88x31/reimoo.png</code> — our own button, drawn for this page (that's us!).</li>
		<li>
			<code>blinkies/88x31-touhoubutton.gif</code> — the classic red 「TOUHOU!」 button, collected from the
			<a href="https://88x31.nl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">88x31.nl button archive</a>
			(<a href="https://88x31.nl/gifs/touhoubutton.gif" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">source file</a>).
		</li>
		<li>
			<code>blinkies/*.gif</code> + <code>blinkies/*.jpg</code> — 25 Touhou animated stamps, collected via
			<a href="https://layouts.spacehey.com/layout?id=101676" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SpaceHey layout 101676</a>
			(hosted on the Pinterest CDN). Original artists unknown — if one of these is yours, write in the guestbook and we'll credit you!
		</li>
		<li>
			<code>src/assets/images/marisa-flying.gif</code> — Marisa Kirisame flying across the screen, via
			<a href="https://layouts.spacehey.com/layout?id=89719" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tenor (SpaceHey layout 89719)</a>.
			Bundled through <code>astro:assets</code>, which serves it optimized (animated WebP).
		</li>
	</ul>

	<details class="stamp-details">
		<summary>Full list of the 25 collected stamps (with original URLs)</summary>
		<div class="provenance-table-wrap">
			<table class="provenance-table">
				<thead>
					<tr><th>Local file</th><th>Original URL</th></tr>
				</thead>
				<tbody>
					{stampSources.map(([local, url]) => (
						<tr><td><code>{local}</code></td><td><a href={url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{url}</a></td></tr>
					))}
				</tbody>
			</table>
		</div>
	</details>

	<h3 class="section-title">Cursors (カーソル)</h3>
	<p class="section-subtitle-desc">
		The custom Windows cursor set in <code>public/cursors/</code> (<code>.ani</code> files + PNG frames) is
		<strong>Hakurei Reimu's Pixel Cursors</strong> by <strong>乱涂乱画BEN</strong>, available as
		<a href="https://ko-fi.com/s/f5e44fa511" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">pay-what-you-want on Ko-fi</a>.
		Go grab it — the shrine maiden cursor is the best part of this site.
	</p>

	<h3 class="section-title">Other Assets (その他)</h3>
	<ul class="credits-list">
		<li><code>public/images/avatars/*.png</code> — guestbook avatars (Reimu, Marisa, Cirno, Sakuya, Sanae, Youmu): preexisting in the repository, origin not documented.</li>
		<li><code>public/wallpaper.webp</code> — the Reimu &amp; Marisa hanami picnic wallpaper (3840×2400 fanart): preexisting in the repository, artist unknown.</li>
	</ul>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
	.provenance-table-wrap {
		overflow-x: auto;
		margin: 1.5rem 0;
	}

	.provenance-table {
		width: 100%;
		border-collapse: collapse;
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 2px solid var(--reimu-red);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
	}

	.provenance-table th {
		background: var(--reimu-red);
		color: #fff;
		padding: 6px 8px;
		text-align: left;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.provenance-table td {
		padding: 6px 8px;
		border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border-light);
		color: var(--text-dim);
		vertical-align: top;
	}

	.provenance-table tr:hover td {
		background: rgba(219, 54, 85, 0.06);
	}

	.credits-list {
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 1px dashed var(--reimu-red);
		padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
		margin: 1.5rem 0;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: var(--text-dim);
		list-style-type: '★ ';
		padding-left: 2.2rem;
	}

	.stamp-details {
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 1px dashed var(--border-light);
		padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
		margin: 1rem 0 2rem;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}

	.stamp-details summary {
		cursor: url('/cursors/Link.png'), pointer;
		color: var(--reimu-red);
		font-weight: bold;
	}

	.stamp-details[open] summary {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}
</style>
